      "notes": "Complete preferred high-temperature BM3 parameterization from Zhao et al. (1997), fitted to the 31 hydrostatic Table 1 P-V-T states. The authors fixed V0=403 A^3 and K0'=5, and varied K0, dK/dT, a, and b. Their alternate K0'=4, K0'=6, and unconstrained-K0' tradeoff solutions remain documented in the source audit rather than being silently combined. The source does not report the regression objective, row weights, parameter covariance, or confidence convention.",
